# Copy to frontend/.env.local and adjust as needed.

# Base URL the dashboard fetches from. Defaults to /api/v1 (relative),
# which works through both the Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) and the
# Docker nginx reverse proxy (nginx.conf) without needing this set at all.
# Only override it if the API is hosted at a different origin than the
# dashboard itself (e.g. deployed separately) -- if you do, also add that
# origin to the backend's SENTINELML_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
